stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Today
    Today --> ReviewYesterday: Plan day with unresolved work
    Today --> Proposal: Plan day without review
    Today --> Draft: Resume planning
    Today --> Draft: Adjust accepted day
    Today --> ReviewDay: Review day
    ReviewDay --> Draft: Bulk decisions and tomorrow draft
    ReviewYesterday --> Proposal: Decide or skip
    Proposal --> Draft: Use proposed schedule
    Draft --> Proposal: Rebuild remaining work preview
    Draft --> ReviewPlan: Review current draft
    ReviewPlan --> Draft: Edit work or agenda
    ReviewPlan --> Accepted: Confirm first plan
    ReviewPlan --> Revised: Confirm adjustment
    Accepted --> Today: Start or go to Today
    Revised --> Today: Continue or go to Today
    Revised --> Accepted: Undo revision
